    "detailed_description": "<strong>WARNING: Kreuzwort++ is only available in German at this point in time.</strong><br><br>Do you love solving tricky puzzles? Then Kreuzwort++ is just the thing for you!<br><br>Take on over 5000 crossword puzzles, find the right words and improve your word knowledge. Whether in between or for hours on end - you set the pace. Are you ready to put your puzzle skills to the test?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Endless puzzle fun with over 5000 exciting crossword puzzles.<br></li><li> Puzzle day and night \u2013 with the integrated dark mode!<br></li><li> For in-between or for hours on end \u2013 your progress is always saved.<br></li><li> Play in flexible window or full screen mode.</li></ul>",
